From 0de98b6712acb834ae014d34ccadd5c057dcca70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:16:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 104/105] Kompakt: every SettingsLib page turns a page per
 swipe

Settings pages its lists through its own PagedScroll, attached in
SettingsPreferenceFragment, so apps that build on SettingsLib's collapsing
toolbar base (LineageParts, PermissionController, DeviceDiagnostics,
CellBroadcastReceiver) still scrolled with the finger. KompaktPaging, a copy
of Settings' PagedScroll and PageGestureListener, is attached to every plain
vertical list in the fragments those activities and fragments host; lists
that already page, grids and carousels keep their own layout manager.

